---
title: Order lifecycle
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    state "Awaiting payment" as AwaitingPayment
    [*] --> AwaitingPayment: order placed
    AwaitingPayment --> Fulfilment: payment received
    AwaitingPayment --> Cancelled: 30 min without payment
    state Fulfilment {
        [*] --> Picking
        Picking --> Packed: all items scanned
        Packed --> Picking: item missing [damaged]
    }
    Fulfilment --> Shipped: handed to carrier
    Fulfilment --> Cancelled: customer cancels
    Shipped --> Shipped: delayed / tell the customer
    Shipped --> Delivered: signed for
    Delivered --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    note right of Cancelled
        Stock is released
    end note
